{"parent.postMessage is called with request.referer which includes the full URL (path/query) instead of just the origin, so the browser rejects the targetOrigin and the resizing message never reaches the parent; should pass only the scheme+host(+port) origin": 0.9696668386459351, "SimpleRSS::Item#content is only populated for Atom <content> nodes; most RSS feeds only have <description>/<content:encoded> so i.content is nil and i.content.scrub will raise NoMethodError, causing the poll job to crash before any posts are imported. Need to fall back to description/content_encoded/summary and guard nil before scrubbing": 0.9442945122718811, "fetch_http silently returns whenever SiteSetting.embed_by_username is blank or resolves to no user, so TopicRetriever never creates an embed (the embed stays stuck on loading when the username is missing/deleted); should surface an error or require a valid username before enqueuing retrieval": 0.909878134727478, "EmbedController#best enqueues retrieval for any embed_url, but TopicRetriever#invalid_host? bails when embed_url host != embeddable_host, so the loader view (which reloads every 30s) never leaves the loading state for mismatched URLs and loops forever; should validate the embed_url host or render an error before enqueueing": 0.9549124836921692}